  "text": "The fault detector reports a failure to the user or user has a suspicion of their own fault. \nThe user shall examine the failure. \nThe user rejects the failure of the fault detector or the user confirms the failure of the fault detector. \nIf the user confirms the failure of the fault detector, he informs the customer and the manager. \nThe user fixes the fault at the measuring device. \nThe user shares the results of the repairs carried out with the fault detector. \nThe user will inform the customer about the resolution of the interference. \nThe user will inform the manager about the resolution of the interference.\n",
